    {
      "source": "Nullability rules are declared using <code>Nullable</code>, <code>NonNullApi</code>, and JSR-305\n<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code> annotations. By default (no annotation use), a package and its types are considered\nallowing null values in return values and method parameters. Nullability rules are expressed by annotating\na package with a JSR-305 meta annotation such as Spring's <code>NonNullApi</code>. All types of the package inherit the\npackage rule. Subpackages do not inherit nullability rules and must be annotated themselves.",
      "translation": "空值规则是使用 `<code>Nullable`、`<code>NonNullApi` 以及 JSR-305 `<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code>` 注解来声明的。默认情况下（不使用任何注解），一个包及其类型被视为允许在返回值和方法参数中使用 null 值。空值规则通过用 JSR-305 元注解（如 Spring 的 `<code>NonNullApi`）标注一个包来表达。该包中的所有类型都会继承此包规则，但子包不会继承空值规则，必须自行进行标注。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code> is suitable for composition of meta-annotations and expresses via\n<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull#when()</code> in which cases non-nullability is applicable.",
      "translation": "<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code> 适用于元注解的组合，并通过 <code>javax.annotation.Nonnull#when()</code> 表达非空性适用的情况。",
      "count": 1
    },
