      "source": "<span class=\"annotations\"><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/lang/Contract.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.lang\">@Contract</a>(\"null, _ -&gt; false\")\n</span><span class=\"modifiers\">public static</span> <span class=\"return-type\">boolean</span> <span class=\"element-name\">isNonNull</span><wbr/><span class=\"parameters\">(@Nullable <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\">AnnotatedElement</a> element,\n <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\">ElementType</a> elementType)</span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"annotations\"><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/lang/Contract.html\" title=\"org.springframework.lang 中的类或接口\">@Contract</a>(\"null, _ -> false\")\n</span><span class=\"modifiers\">public static</span> <span class=\"return-type\">boolean</span> <span class=\"element-name\">isNonNull</span><wbr/><span class=\"parameters\">(@Nullable <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\">AnnotatedElement</a> element,\n <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"java.lang.annotation 中的类或接口\">ElementType</a> elementType)</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a> is explicitly annotated to be considered nullable. Nullability rules\nare discovered from method and parameter annotations. A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a> is considered nullable when\n<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code> is set to one of <code>javax.annotation.meta.When#UNKNOWN</code>,\n<code>javax.annotation.meta.When#NEVER</code>, or <code>javax.annotation.meta.When#MAYBE</code>.",
      "translation": "确定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a>是否被显式注解为可空。可空性规则是从方法和参数注解中发现的。当<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code>设置为<code>javax.annotation.meta.When#UNKNOWN</code>、<code>javax.annotation.meta.When#NEVER</code>或<code>javax.annotation.meta.When#MAYBE</code>之一时，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a>被视为可空。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
