    {
      "source": "Determine whether <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a> in the scope of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> requires non-null values.\nNon-nullability rules are discovered from class and package annotations. Non-null is applied when\n<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code> is set to <code>javax.annotation.meta.When#ALWAYS</code>.",
      "translation": "确定在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> 范围内，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a> 是否需要非空值。非空性规则是从类和包注解中推导出来的。当 <code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code> 设置为 <code>javax.annotation.meta.When#ALWAYS</code> 时，应用非空约束。",
      "count": 1
