    {
      "source": "Determine whether <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a> in the scope of <code>type</code> requires non-null values.\nNon-nullability rules are discovered from class and package annotations. Non-null is applied when\n<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code> is set to <code>javax.annotation.meta.When#ALWAYS</code>.",
      "translation": "确定在 `type` 作用域内的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a>` 是否需要非空值。非空性规则是从类和包注解中发现的。当 `<code>javax.annotation.Nonnull</code>` 设置为 `<code>javax.annotation.meta.When#ALWAYS</code>` 时，应用非空规则。",
      "count": 1
