    {
      "source": "Determine whether <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a> in the scope of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a> requires non-null values.\nThis method determines default <code>javax.annotation.Nonnull nullability</code> rules from the annotated element",
      "translation": "确定在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a> 范围内，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a> 是否需要非空值。\n此方法根据已注解的元素确定默认的 <code>javax.annotation.Nonnull nullability</code> 规则。",
