    {
      "source": "since 4.0 in favor of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/Nullness.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Nullness</code></a> fully using JSpecify annotations instead\n            of Spring Framework's own @Nullable and @NonNullApi annotations.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，全面采用 JSpecify 注解，以替代 Spring Framework 自身的@Nullable 和@NonNullApi 注解，转而使用<code>Nullness</code>类（位于org.springframework.core包中）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a> is explicitly annotated to be considered nullable.",
      "translation": "确定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core 中的类或接口\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a> 是否被显式注解为可空。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"#skip-navbar-top\" title=\"Skip navigation links\">Skip navigation links</a>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"#skip-navbar-top\" title=\"跳过导航链接\">跳过导航链接</a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<h1 class=\"title\" title=\"Class NullableUtils\">Class NullableUtils</h1>",
      "translation": "<h1 class=\"title\" title=\"类 NullableUtils\">类 NullableUtils</h1>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Core",
      "translation": "Spring Data 核心",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Modifier and Type",
      "translation": "修改类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>element</code> - the scope of declaration, may be a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Package.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Package</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>, or\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>. Can be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>elementType</code> - the element type.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>false if <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a> allows null values by default or if the given\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a> is null.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>element</code> - 声明的作用域，可以是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Package.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Package</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Class</code></a> 或\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a>。可为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>elementType</code> - 元素类型。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"java.lang.annotation 中的类或接口\"><code>ElementType</code></a> 默认允许 null 值，或者给定的\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a> 为 null 时，返回 false。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>method</code> - the method to inspect.</dd>\n<dd><code>elementType</code> - the element type.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>false if <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a> allows null values by default. true if the\n        methods return type is a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#isPrimitive()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>primitive</code></a> and false if the method is\n        void.</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><code>isNonNull(Annotation, ElementType)</code></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>method</code> - 要检查的方法。</dd>\n<dd><code>elementType</code> - 元素类型。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"java.lang.annotation 中的类或接口\"><code>ElementType</code></a> 默认允许 null 值，则返回 false；如果方法的返回类型是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#isPrimitive()\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>primitive</code></a>（基本类型），则返回 true；如果方法为 void，则返回 false。</dd>\n<dt>另请参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><code>isNonNull(Annotation, ElementType)</code></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>type</code> - the class to inspect.</dd>\n<dd><code>elementType</code> - the element type.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>false if <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>ElementType</code></a> allows null values. true the given\n        type is a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#isPrimitive()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>primitive</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><code>isNonNull(Annotation, ElementType)</code></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>type</code> - 要检查的类。</dd>\n<dd><code>elementType</code> - 元素类型。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html\" title=\"java.lang.annotation 中的类或接口\"><code>ElementType</code></a> 允许 null 值，则返回 false；否则，如果给定的 type 是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#isPrimitive()\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>primitive</code></a>（基本类型），则返回 true。</dd>\n<dt>另请参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><code>isNonNull(Annotation, ElementType)</code></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">Description</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Details</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#isNonNull(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.annotation.ElementType)\" tabindex=\"0\">isNonNull(Method, ElementType)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#isNonNull(java.lang.Class,java.lang.annotation.ElementType)\" tabindex=\"0\">isNonNull(Class, ElementType)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#isNonNull(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement,java.lang.annotation.ElementType)\" tabindex=\"0\">isNonNull(AnnotatedElement, ElementType)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#isExplicitNullable(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" tabindex=\"0\">isExplicitNullable(MethodParameter)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
      "translation": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">描述</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">方法摘要</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">方法详情</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#isNonNull(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.annotation.ElementType)\" tabindex=\"0\">isNonNull(Method, ElementType)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#isNonNull(java.lang.Class,java.lang.annotation.ElementType)\" tabindex=\"0\">isNonNull(Class, ElementType)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#isNonNull(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement,java.lang.annotation.ElementType)\" tabindex=\"0\">isNonNull(AnnotatedElement, ElementType)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#isExplicitNullable(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" tabindex=\"0\">isExplicitNullable(MethodParameter)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>\n<dt>Author:</dt>\n<dd>Mark Paluch</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/lang/NonNullApi.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.lang\"><code>NonNullApi</code></a></li>\n<li><code>Nullable</code></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>\n<dt>作者：</dt>\n<dd>Mark Paluch</dd>\n<dt>参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/lang/NonNullApi.html\" title=\"org.springframework.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>NonNullApi</code></a></li>\n<li><code>Nullable</code></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>methodParameter</code> - the method parameter to inspect.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>true if the parameter is nullable, false otherwise.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>methodParameter</code> - 要检查的方法参数。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>如果该参数为可空类型，则返回 true；否则返回 false。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
